1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:12,836
Accounts screen par dukaan ka roz ka hisaab hai.

2
00:00:12,876 --> 00:00:19,879
Sabse pehle expense entry: kiraaya, tankhwaah,
bijli, internet, transport, marammat,

3
00:00:19,919 --> 00:00:22,143
stationery ya bank charges.

4
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:27,420
Category Repairs, amount aath sau pachaas,
bhugtaan cash se,

5
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,155
aur note mein likhiye kya theek hua.

6
00:00:30,195 --> 00:00:32,663
'Add expense for today' dabaaiye.

7
00:00:33,421 --> 00:00:38,813
Cash book mein aaj ka har len-den hai: bikri ka
cash, customers se vasooli,

8
00:00:38,853 --> 00:00:42,797
supplier payments aur kharch, ant mein In, Out
aur Net.

9
00:00:43,575 --> 00:00:46,762
Bank ka hisaab 'UPI & Bank' screen par hai.

10
00:00:46,802 --> 00:00:53,291
Bank statement Excel ya CSV mein upload kijiye;
Medoro har UPI aur bank credit ko bills

11
00:00:53,331 --> 00:00:58,619
aur payments se milaata hai, aur jo nahi mile,
unhein alag dikhata hai.

12
00:00:59,396 --> 00:01:05,187
Munaafa 'Reports & GST' screen par 'Sales and
profit' mein hai: taareekh-vaar bikri,

13
00:01:05,227 --> 00:01:06,923
returns aur gross profit.

14
00:01:06,963 --> 00:01:10,810
Ise CSV mein nikaalkar apne accountant ko de
sakte hain.

15
00:01:11,559 --> 00:01:15,304
Poori kitaabein 'Books & registers' screen par
hain.

16
00:01:15,344 --> 00:01:21,637
Day book mein kisi bhi din ka har len-den
voucher ke roop mein hai: bikri, credit note,

17
00:01:21,677 --> 00:01:26,223
vasooli, khareed, payment aur kharch, har ek ka
naame aur jama.

18
00:01:26,969 --> 00:01:32,352
Trial balance mein har ledger ka naame aur jama
hai, aur upar Balanced likha aata hai,

19
00:01:32,392 --> 00:01:34,622
yaani dono taraf ka jod barabar hai.

20
00:01:35,386 --> 00:01:40,313
Profit & loss mein shuddh bikri, bike maal ki
laagat, sakal munaafa,

21
00:01:40,353 --> 00:01:44,112
har tarah ka kharch, aur aakhir mein shuddh
munaafa.

22
00:01:44,152 --> 00:01:47,910
Taareekh badalkar kisi bhi avadhi ka hisaab
dekhiye.

23
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:52,951
Cash flow ki alag report abhi nahi hai; paise ka
aana-jaana cash book

24
00:01:52,991 --> 00:01:55,069
aur day book mein dikhta hai.

25
00:02:01,110 --> 00:02:05,173
Medicine ki MRP mein GST pehle se shaamil hota
hai.

26
00:02:05,213 --> 00:02:09,518
Medoro har bill par MRP se taxable value
nikaalta hai,

27
00:02:09,558 --> 00:02:16,518
aur Jharkhand ke andar ki bikri par GST ko CGST
aur SGST mein aadha-aadha baant'ta hai.

28
00:02:16,558 --> 00:02:20,782
Doosre rajya ke GST wale customer par IGST lagta
hai.

29
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:26,723
Har medicine ka HSN code aur GST rate uske
master mein rehta hai,

30
00:02:26,763 --> 00:02:29,058
jaise medicines ke liye 3004.

31
00:02:29,098 --> 00:02:33,727
'Reports & GST' screen par GST returns wala
hissa dekhiye.

32
00:02:34,468 --> 00:02:36,147
GST month chuniye.

33
00:02:36,187 --> 00:02:43,120
Medoro us mahine ke bills se GSTR-1 banata hai:
B2B, B2C aur HSN summary,

34
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:47,322
section-wise taxable value aur tax ke saath.

35
00:02:48,066 --> 00:02:55,430
Yahan se GSTR-1 JSON, jo GST portal ke offline
tool mein jaata hai, HSN summary CSV,

36
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:59,572
aur GSTR-3B ke JSON aur CSV download hote hain.

37
00:03:00,337 --> 00:03:02,772
Aapka CA Tally istemaal karta hai?

38
00:03:02,812 --> 00:03:10,343
'Books & registers' mein Tally export se Tally
Prime ke liye XML banta hai: pehle ledgers yaani
masters,

39
00:03:10,383 --> 00:03:11,362
phir vouchers.

40
00:03:11,402 --> 00:03:16,967
Tally mein Import karte hi bikri, khareed,
payments aur kharch aa jaate hain,

41
00:03:17,007 --> 00:03:20,243
har customer aur supplier ke ledger ke saath.

42
00:03:21,016 --> 00:03:25,861
Bahut zaroori: yeh reports aur exports filing
mein madad ke liye hain.

43
00:03:25,901 --> 00:03:31,862
GST return file karne se pehle inhein apne
accountant ya CA se zaroor check karvaaiye.
